{"3926400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starship Dice", "steam_appid": 3926400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your fleet with different weapons and equipment, and return to base with loot. The fleet will engage in automatic battles in three-dimensional space, and you will plan the star map route and action mode, but it is best to pray for permission from the God of Dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fleet uses a self-propelled chess battle mode, where the fleet automatically engages in combat and players cannot intervene, but can choose to retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each warship has a backpack filled with weapons and equipment, and try to keep any additional equipment as close to the weapons as possible. But space should also be reserved for spoils of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will be tested with dice, fortunately, you can carry items to increase or upgrade dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926400/extras/4f5513f14058ad70c00d696d236194b7.poster.avif?t=1780235534\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926400/extras/4f5513f14058ad70c00d696d236194b7.webm?t=1780235534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926400/extras/4f5513f14058ad70c00d696d236194b7.mp4?t=1780235534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926400/extras/5befd9113479293f0c74652b53298039.poster.avif?t=1780235534\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926400/extras/5befd9113479293f0c74652b53298039.webm?t=1780235534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926400/extras/5befd9113479293f0c74652b53298039.mp4?t=1780235534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your fleet with different weapons and equipment, and return to base with loot. The fleet will engage in automatic battles in three-dimensional space, and you will plan the star map route and action mode, but it is best to pray for permission from the God of Dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fleet uses a self-propelled chess battle mode, where the fleet automatically engages in combat and players cannot intervene, but can choose to retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each warship has a backpack filled with weapons and equipment, and try to keep any additional equipment as close to the weapons as possible. But space should also be reserved for spoils of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will be tested with dice, fortunately, you can carry items to increase or upgrade dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926400/extras/4f5513f14058ad70c00d696d236194b7.poster.avif?t=1780235534\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926400/extras/4f5513f14058ad70c00d696d236194b7.webm?t=1780235534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926400/extras/4f5513f14058ad70c00d696d236194b7.mp4?t=1780235534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926400/extras/5befd9113479293f0c74652b53298039.poster.avi